  "body": "Procedure rework requested by the user: issues start from the latest main on their own branch, finish as a pushed branch with a PR (not a merge to main), and a release cut goes PR review -> merge to main -> tag.\n\n- AGENTS.md Issue Law: start/branch, done = push + PR, `in-review` label, changelog rows at the cut.\n- AGENTS.md Commits and Releases: the four-step cut (review + merge issue PRs, release branch + gate, release PR, tag main).\n- scripts/release.ps1: `-NoTag` (parse-checked).\n- RECOMMENDED.md: the seven decisions taken filling in the mechanics.\n\nChangelog: none (docs/process only)\n",
